\n            </table>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n    <div class=\"contents\">\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"js-menu\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n    <div class=\"contents\">\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n            <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n            <p>閉店3～3時間半前</p>\n            <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n            <p>★★★★★</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <h3>解説</h3>\n            <p>純増が低い上に有利区間が切れた後の裏天国が強く欠損の発生しやすい機種。出玉率も低いので早めにやめるのが無難です。</p>\n            <p>32Gを抜けた時にモードB以上が確定してなかった場合は閉店まで3時間半を切っていたらやめ。通常B以上の場合は32Gを抜けた時に閉店まで2時間を切っていたらやめ。</p>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n    <div class=\"contents\">\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <h3>ボーナス確率</h3>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>設定</th>\n                        <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">ボーナス<br>初当り</th>\n                        <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">ボーナス<br>合算</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>1/252.9</td>\n                        <td>1/117.5</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>1/245.5</td>\n                        <td>1/114.3</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定4</td>\n                        <td>1/231.9</td>\n                        <td>1/108.5</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>1/216.1</td>\n                        <td>1/101.8</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>1/202.6</td>\n                        <td>1/96.0</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <h3>出玉率</h3>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">設定</th>\n                        <th>出玉率</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>97.5%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>98.5%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定4</td>\n                        <td>102.3%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>104.9%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>107.3%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n    <div class=\"contents\">\n        <div class=\"left\">\n            <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                        <th>記載</th>\n                    </tr><tr>\n                        <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            <a href=\"javascript:void(0);\